---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	title: "Home",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<section>
		<h1 class="title mb-2">Mahan Balooei</h1>
		<p class="text-accent mb-1 text-base font-semibold sm:text-lg">
			Protein Language Models · Variant-Effect Prediction · Machine Learning for Biology
		</p>
		<p class="text-muted mb-8 text-sm">MSc Bioinformatics, University of Bologna</p>

		<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
			<p>
				I am an MSc student in Bioinformatics at the University of Bologna with a background in
				Medical Laboratory Sciences. My research interests lie at the intersection of machine
				learning and computational biology, with a particular focus on protein language models,
				variant-effect prediction, and biological representation learning.
			</p>
			<p>
				My current MSc thesis focuses on modernizing the E-SNPs&amp;GO framework for predicting the
				pathogenicity of human missense variants using updated human variant datasets and
				contemporary protein language models. Previously, I have worked on ESM-2-based signal-peptide
				prediction, profile-HMM and MMseqs2 protein annotation, and computational epigenomics.
			</p>
			<p>
				I am currently exploring PhD opportunities for Fall 2027 in computational biology,
				machine learning for biology, biological foundation models, and related areas.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12">
		<h2 class="title text-accent mb-4 text-lg">Research Interests</h2>
		<ul class="marker:text-accent list-disc space-y-1.5 ps-5 text-sm" role="list">
			<li>Protein language models and foundation models</li>
			<li>Machine learning for biological data</li>
			<li>Variant-effect and pathogenicity prediction</li>
			<li>Computational genomics and multi-omics</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12">
		<h2 class="title text-accent mb-4 text-lg">Current Research</h2>
		<div class="text-sm">
			<p class="font-semibold">Protein Language Models for Human Protein Variant Pathogenicity Prediction</p>
			<p class="text-muted mt-1">
				MSc Thesis · University of Bologna · Ongoing
			</p>
			<p class="mt-2">
				Modernizing the E-SNPs&amp;GO framework for missense variant pathogenicity prediction through
				updated human variant datasets and contemporary protein language models.
			</p>
			<p class="text-muted mt-2">
				Supervisors: Castrense Savojardo · Pier Luigi Martelli · Matteo Manfredi
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12">
		<h2 class="title text-accent mb-4 text-lg">Selected Publication</h2>
		<div class="text-sm">
			<p class="font-semibold">
				Mechanism-based targeting of lactate dehydrogenase tetramerization by naturally derived
				compounds: A survey of molecular docking, molecular dynamics, and QSAR analysis
			</p>
			<p class="text-muted mt-1">
				<em>Computers in Biology and Medicine</em>, 197(Pt B), 111000 (2025) · Equal-contributing author
			</p>
			<p class="mt-2">
				The study investigated naturally derived compounds targeting LDH tetramerization using
				molecular docking, molecular dynamics, and QSAR analyses.
			</p>
			<a
				class="cactus-link mt-2 inline-block font-semibold"
				href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compbiomed.2025.111000"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank"
			>
				Paper →
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm">
		<a class="cactus-link" href="/research/">Research →</a>
		<a class="cactus-link" href="/publications/">Publications →</a>
		<a class="cactus-link" href="/cv/">CV →</a>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
